WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.911
Kivo’s Browser Extension saves pages while you browse

2
00:00:05.911 --> 00:00:10.609
1 · Add it to Chrome, then connect it with a code

3
00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:16.325
Type the code into the extension and press Connect

4
00:00:16.325 --> 00:00:24.468
Connected. Kivo shows which browser

5
00:00:24.468 --> 00:00:30.631
2 · On any page, click Kivo in the toolbar and press Save page

6
00:00:30.631 --> 00:00:33.233
Saved. Nothing else from the page is kept

7
00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:38.877
3 · Saved pages land here, ready to read, organise and study

8
00:00:38.877 --> 00:00:44.169
4 · Press Study to start a focus session on it

9
00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:47.671
Pages filed under a subject also show on your Knowledge Map
